    {
      "id": "u_b28c0d37131ebd1651b6499b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As Trilium can be run in Docker it also can be deployed in Kubernetes. You can either use our Helm chart, a community Helm chart, or roll your own Kubernetes deployment.",
      "sourceHash": "b28c0d37131ebd1651b6499bd653ec18142a814e2556a8267f54cafb30ab8aa7",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes",
      "contextHash": "1db8704f2dddba6d4bcaf8e5920ec2d02b7aef6f2559ea3bc37d199ea65a5b6e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Trilium は Docker で実行できるため、Kubernetes にデプロイすることも可能です。公式の Helm チャート、コミュニティ製の Helm チャートのいずれかを使用するか、独自の Kubernetes デプロイメントを構築してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9c4c3596d992c18402a43fb5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The recommended way is to use a Helm chart.",
      "sourceHash": "9c4c3596d992c18402a43fb590b53df4086cd475c2d1db438f62f14853a3e9c6",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes",
      "contextHash": "1db8704f2dddba6d4bcaf8e5920ec2d02b7aef6f2559ea3bc37d199ea65a5b6e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "推奨される方法は Helm チャートを使用することです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6a8ea75662e6edfcb8918666_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Root privileges__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "6a8ea75662e6edfcb891866656b947c23a0893fe9a57479f68cc456b25dcae79",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes > Root privileges",
      "contextHash": "fbff6a41e01f5e86893e6ce9dc43cf917ccce31d65071a14616a99c1a84d906c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "root 権限__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6aa7d3b0693d98d8dc0f8476_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, the Trilium container starts as root, gives the data directory to UID and GID __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and then runs Trilium with those reduced privileges, so no init container is needed to fix the permissions. To use a different UID and GID, set the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__ environment variables.",
      "sourceHash": "6aa7d3b0693d98d8dc0f8476ccc9ad35ec6a95681aa4776da64cbd26490675cf",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes > Root privileges",
      "contextHash": "fbff6a41e01f5e86893e6ce9dc43cf917ccce31d65071a14616a99c1a84d906c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "デフォルトでは、Trilium コンテナは root として起動し、データディレクトリの所有権を UID と GID __TRILIUM_PH_0__ に譲渡してから、権限を削減した状態で Trilium を実行します。そのため、権限を修正するための初期化コンテナは不要です。別の UID と GID を使用するには、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ および __TRILIUM_PH_2__ 環境変数を設定してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cf6f977bf299fa8e26743f32_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.107.0, the container can also run without root, which a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ Pod Security Standard requires. Set the user in the pod's security context, and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ so that Kubernetes gives the volume to that group:",
      "sourceHash": "cf6f977bf299fa8e26743f32f120406536772be3277ccc419962e5a299a0b46d",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes > Root privileges",
      "contextHash": "fbff6a41e01f5e86893e6ce9dc43cf917ccce31d65071a14616a99c1a84d906c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "v0.107.0 以降では、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ Pod Security Standard で求められる非 root でのコンテナ実行も可能です。Kubernetes がボリュームをそのグループに割り当てるように、Pod のセキュリティコンテキストでユーザーと __TRILIUM_PH_1__ を設定してください：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8ecb6cf285eeb5864261b60d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In that mode __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ are ignored. See the section on running as a non-root user in __TRILIUM_PH_2__Using Docker__TRILIUM_PH_3__ for what the data directory needs.",
      "sourceHash": "8ecb6cf285eeb5864261b60de051c876ef20ffafb6743ce94b031362c481d6c0",
      "context": "Using Kubernetes > Root privileges",
      "contextHash": "fbff6a41e01f5e86893e6ce9dc43cf917ccce31d65071a14616a99c1a84d906c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "そのモードでは、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ と __TRILIUM_PH_1__ は無視されます。データディレクトリに必要な要件については、__TRILIUM_PH_2__Docker の使用__TRILIUM_PH_3__ の非 root ユーザーとしての実行に関するセクションを参照してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
